{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Right then, that is it from the game. We only saw\u00a0two overs in the game courtesy of the rain playing spoilsport here at\u00a0Buffalo Park. India Women\u00a0will now play against\u00a0West Indies Women on Monday, 30th of January before the finals. The game will begin at 6.30 pm IST (1.00 pm GMT). Do join us a bit early for the build-up. Until then, goodbye and cheers!", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T19:37:24+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Update 12.59\u00a0am IST (7.29\u00a0am GMT) - That's it, the inevitable has happened! THE MATCH HAS BEEN CALLED OFF! The rain gods have spoiled the game. The\u00a0match was a dead rubber though, as both teams have already made their way into the finals.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T19:29:08+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Update 12.37 am IST (7.07 am GMT) - Nothing much to update and we haven't had any official updates for quite a while now.\u00a0We will keep you posted if we have anything. Also, the cut-off time for a 5-over game is 1.30 am IST.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T19:07:00+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Sunday, 29th of January is a big day for Indian Cricket as the U19 India Women will be fighting against U19 England Women in the finals of the ICC Under 19 Women's T20 World Cup. The game will begin at 5.15 pm IST (2.45 am GMT). Do join us for the same as well to cheer for them!", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T18:29:54+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Update 11.47\u00a0pm IST (6.17\u00a0pm GMT) - It has been more than an hour since the match is interrupted due to rain now, and\u00a0loss of overs is likely to happen if play resumes! We will keep you posted as soon as we get any updates.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T18:17:21+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "