 "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T16:54:04+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "South Africa Women (Playing XI) - Tazmin Brits (C), Laura Wolvaardt, Marizanne Kapp, Sune Luus, Chloe Tryon, Annerie Dercksen, Nadine de Klerk, Sinalo Jafta (WK), Tumi Sekhukhune, Shabnim Ismail (In for Masabata Klaas), Nonkululeko Mlaba.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T16:36:34+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "India Women (Playing XI) - Harmanpreet Kaur (C), Smriti Mandhana, Yastika Bhatia (WK), Harleen Deol, Jemimah Rodrigues, Devika Vaidya, Deepti Sharma, Pooja Vastrakar (n for Amanjot Kaur), Radha Yadav, Shikha Pandey, Rajeshwari Gayakwad.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T16:36:16+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "TOSS - India Women\u00a0have won the toss and will BAT first.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T16:34:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Both teams are coming off wins in their previous matches, which gives them additional confidence coming into this battle. The home team will be seeking vengeance and will look to win the game before going into the finals. Indian Women, on the other hand, will look to maintain their dominance in the series. Which side will come out on top? Let's find out together. Toss and team news in a bit.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-28T16:12:09+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "0", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "The Women\u2019s T20 World Cup is just around the corner and this tri-series between India Women, South Africa Women and West Indies Women have provided these teams with a great opportunity to fine-tune their preparation ahead of the mega event. West Indies though have dished out some disappointing performances and that means India and South Africa would play the final of the tri-series in this beautiful rainbow nation. However, before they play for that trophy in the final, it is time for match 5 of the series where India and South Africa will lock horns in what could be considered a dress rehearsal and perhaps an opportunity for both teams to try out some different combinations. Indian Women have been the most dominant team in the series with two impressive wins and continue to take their game a notch higher as we move towards the all-important World Cup. In the first game against South Africa Women, after a below-par start by the top order, Deepti Sharma and young all-rounder Amanjot Kaur took India to a respectable total which was followed by a clinical bowling performance. Against the Windies though, the big guns, Smriti Mandhana and Harmanpreet Kaur took charge to take India to a big total which proved too much for the girls from Caribbean. Overall, India look quite a settled unit but they would hope that Jemimah Rodrigues finds her touch while the presence of plenty of all-rounders provides Harmanpreet Kaur with plenty of options to work with in crunch situations. India would hope to continue the momentum forward and deliver another strong performance. The home side, South Africa Women, on the other hand, have been dominant against the West Indies but their batting faltered against India Women. Marizanne Kapp remains a key figure in their team while Laura Wolvaardt and Tazmin Brits too got looked fluent in the last game. They do have a quality pace attack which has been their strength over the years and if they can get their act together with the bat against India, we might see a close and thrilling encounter here. Can South Africa Women avenge their defeat in the opening game of the tri-series to take that confidence into the final? Or will India Women overpower them again? Let\u2019s find out.", "Timestamp": "2023-01-17T05:57:28+00:00", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "InningNo": "1", "BattingTeam_Id": "1126", "BattingTeam": "India", "BowlingTeam_Id": "1131", "BowlingTeam": "South Africa", "GameCode": "sawinw01282023219143", "MatchId": "219143", "Timestamp": "01/29/2023T01:09:31+05:30", "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 28, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:20:31 AM"}}}